<tr><td>Other cutaneous lesions：panniculitis、granuloma annulare、erythema multiforme、syphilis-like papulosquamous eruption</td><td>Weeks to months to years（early or late）</td><td>Erythema nodosum；insect bite reaction；drug eruption；secondary syphilis</td></tr>
</tbody>
